ly report\n\n## Regression\n- final field checks: 34/34\n- strict first-pass schema: 34/34\n- historical [3] -> [1] corrections: 3/3\n- known duplicate-mark responses rejected by count gate: 2/2\n- silent missing rows: 0\n- API-key leakage, paid external calls, remote/canonical writes: 0\n- combined recorded mean latency: 42.601 seconds/question\n\n## Verification\n- /tmp/ai2-vlm-probe-venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1620_local_two_pass.test.py -v (11 passed)\n- predecessor #1616 and #1618 focused tests (14 passed)\n- exact replay regeneration byte-matches the committed regression artifact\n- npm run quality:report-index\n- npm run lint:changed\n- npm run quality:a-plus:ratchet\n- npm run build\n- npm run deploy:secret-scan\n- npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json\n\nA fresh repo-external smoke also reached an intentional resumable checkpoint at 16/34 with 16/16 field matches, 32 hashed raw responses, zero duplicate attempts after restart, and zero API-key matches.","created_at":"2026-07-19T15:10:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T15:47:30Z","closed_at":"2026-07-19T15:44:59Z","merged_at":"2026-07-19T15:44:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"068b2abf8202ef037eec11803af29461ad6f7526","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1623/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1623/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1623/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/0b21768e58d6802f47e08dc7baca8d2b088aee73","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1620-local-vlm-two-pass-runner","ref":"task/1620-local-vlm-two-pass-runner","sha":"0b21768e58d6802f47e08dc7baca8d2b088aee73","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id